# GUIDANCE V1.2

> **Purpose**: Domain-specific patterns, few-shot examples, decision matrices, quality checklist, edge-case handling, infer-first / Jira-parsing patterns for WSR email composition.
>
> **v1.2 update**: All inference (reference reading, Jira paste parsing, gap aggregation) is LLM-native — no parser/inference scripts. The 9 retained scripts are limited to: 6 format-compliance validators, 1 HTML builder, 2 math calculators.

---

## 1. SALESFORCE GDC WSR DOMAIN OVERVIEW

WSR emails are parsed by the **Collab App** at `gdc-project-collaboration@salesforce.com`. Non-compliant emails are silently discarded — users may not realize their submission failed. This agent eliminates that silent-failure risk through deterministic validation.

**Downstream records auto-created on success** (ref: guidelines lines 131-136):
- `GDC_DG_Project__c` — Project record
- `GDC_DG_WSRep__c` — WSR record with all metrics
- `EmailMessage` — Email record linked to project
- Attachments linked to both

Processing time: typically 1-2 minutes after send.

