## 3. FEW-SHOT PATTERNS — Summary of WSR

### ❌ BAD: Flat bullets, no hierarchy
```
Summary of WSR:
- Sprint 4 started
- Working on Zycus
- Working on Heilite
- UAT support
- Austria, Spain
```
**Why wrong:** No context grouping; leadership can't scan for workstream/team.

### ✅ GOOD: Hierarchical (Heineken pattern)
```
Summary of WSR:
- The team is currently in Sprint 4 and working on user stories pertaining to below OpCo's (Operating Countries)
  - Build: New Caledonia Block 3 & 4, US, Zycus Non DBB, Heilite 1
  - Design: New Caledonia (Block 3), CFIN, & Heilite(1&2)
  - UAT Support: Austria, Spain, Zycus DBB
  - Business Go live: New Zealand & New Caledonia
- Team 1: Working on the build for Zycus Non-DBB, Helite 1 and supporting UAT for Zycus DBB
- Team 2: Working on the build for New Caledonia Block 3&4 and supporting UAT for Spain
- Team 3: Working on HUSA Medium & High priority stories and supporting UAT for Austria
- Platform Team update:
  Completed:
    - Code Reviews & Pipelines: Successfully finished code reviews for multiple APIs...
    - Assessments & Policies: Concluded the New Relic Assessment for MuleSoft...
  In Progress:
    - Active Development: Building the email notification functionality for the Audit API...
    - Deployment & Troubleshooting: Preparing to support the early morning production deployment...
```

