## 5. FEW-SHOT PATTERNS — Delivery Metrics

### ❌ BAD: American spelling + % on DpD
```
Capacity Utilization: 100%
User Stories Delivered: 23%
Defects Per Days: 0.02%
```
**Issues:**
- `Utilization` → must be British `Utilisation` (guidelines line 82)
- `User Stories Delivered` (plural) → must be exact `User Story Delivered` (line 92)
- `0.02%` → must be decimal `0.02` with NO `%` (line 102)

### ✅ GOOD: Correct names + formats
```
Delivery Metrics- Sprint 4

Metric                     | Details                           | Comments
Capacity Utilisation: 100% | Capacity: 102 vs Planned: 102     | Blocked stories assigned mid-sprint
User Story Delivered: 23%  | Planned: 43 vs Dev Completed: 10  | Sprint 4 In Progress from 8-Apr to 21-Apr

2026 Release
Phase              | Days | Valid Defects | Defect Per Days (DpD)
Build              | 579  | 0             | 0.00
SIT                | 579  | 4             | 0.01
UAT                | 579  | 5             | 0.01
PROD               | 0    | 0             | 0.00
Over All Delivery  | 579  | 9             | 0.02
```

