## 7. DECISION MATRIX — Summary Grouping

| Project Organization | Preferred Summary Grouping |
|---------------------|----------------------------|
| Distinct workstreams (Build / Design / UAT / Go-live) | Workstream-first (like Heineken example) |
| Teams own end-to-end scopes | Team-first (Team 1, Team 2, ...) |
| Mixed (workstreams + cross-team) | Workstream-first with team breakdowns nested |
| Single small team | Flat list grouped by theme (development, testing, deployment) |

### Decision Tree
```
Does the project have named workstreams distinct from team boundaries? → YES → workstream-first
Do teams span multiple workstreams? → YES → workstream-first with team nesting
Otherwise → team-first or flat-themed
```

