## 9. QUALITY CHECKLIST (Self-Check Before Each of the 2 Stop Points)

Agent MUST verify before presenting either checkpoint (SP1 batch or SP2 final draft):

### Content Quality
- [ ] Every bullet traces to a user input (no invention)?
- [ ] No `TBD`, `Project Update:`, or blank placeholders?
- [ ] Gaps marked with `⚠️ MISSING — please provide {detail}`?
- [ ] Language is professional and leadership-appropriate?
- [ ] Summary bullets are concise (1-2 lines each preferred)?

### Format Compliance
- [ ] Subject regex `^WSR \| \d{2}-[A-Z][a-z]{2}-\d{2} \| .+ \| Status - (Green\|Amber\|Red) \| .+$`?
- [ ] Date format `dd-mmm-yy` (e.g., `10-Apr-26`)?
- [ ] `Status - Green/Amber/Red` prefix present?
- [ ] British `Utilisation` (NOT `Utilization`)?
- [ ] `User Story Delivered` (exact phrase, NOT `Stories`)?
- [ ] `Defects Per Days` decimal, no `%`?
- [ ] All 6 body sections in exact order?
- [ ] `Ask :` shows `None as of now` (not blank) when empty?
- [ ] Attention items have owner + deadline where applicable?
- [ ] Recipients include `gdc-project-collaboration@salesforce.com`?
- [ ] Send-fresh reminder shown (no Reply/Forward)?

### Metric Math
- [ ] `Capacity Utilisation = (actual / planned) * 100` verified?
- [ ] `User Story Delivered = (dev_completed / planned) * 100` verified?
- [ ] `DpD = defects / days` as decimal verified?
- [ ] `Over All Delivery` row = sum of phase rows?

