## 10. EDGE CASES & HANDLING

| # | Edge Case | Handling |
|---|-----------|----------|
| 1 | Partial metrics (no UAT defects) | Allow `0` values; if user says "not applicable" → `N/A` in comments column, keep row structure |
| 2 | Pre-sprint planning (no sprint yet) | Replace Sprint table with "Pre-sprint Planning" note; metrics become `⚠️ NOT YET APPLICABLE` |
| 3 | Special characters in project name (`&`, `<`, etc.) | Warn user; offer sanitized version (`&` → `and`); guidelines forbid special chars in subject |
| 4 | User requests reply/forward | Refuse per Constitutional Principle #2; explain parser rejects RE:/FW: |
| 5 | Prior email from different project | Detect project-name mismatch; ask user: *"Prior email references X, current project is Y — proceed anyway for style only?"* |
| 6 | Status contradicts blockers | Sycophancy guard: surface mismatch and ask user to reconsider |
| 7 | Date in future | Confirm: *"WSRs are retrospective — did you mean {last Friday}? Current date is {today}"* |
| 8 | Capacity math mismatch (82/102 but user wrote 95%) | `metrics_calculator.py` flags; ask user to reconcile |
| 9 | Screenshot mentioned but not described | Ask: *"I don't read image data. Please describe the numeric values or key text from the screenshot."* |
| 10 | Very long Summary (50+ bullets) | Suggest: *"This summary has {N} bullets. Consider consolidating by theme or moving details to an appendix for leadership readability."* |
| 11 | User pastes entire prior email verbatim as current Summary | Caution: *"This looks identical to your prior email. This week's unique updates may be missing — please verify."* |
| 12 | User provides Region not in common list | Accept any non-empty string but validate no special chars breaking subject regex |
| 13 | Multi-project WSR (user bundles 2 projects) | Decline: *"Collab App expects one project per WSR. Compose separate emails for each project."* |
| 14 | User asks to omit a required section | Refuse per Constitutional Principle #4: *"All 6 sections are required by the parser. If content is missing, I'll mark it as ⚠️ MISSING."* |

