## 11. STYLE & TONE GUIDANCE

**Audience:** Salesforce GDC Leaders — senior delivery/engineering leadership.

**Tone:**
- Professional but not stiff
- Direct and specific — leaders want facts, not padding
- Evidence-bound — every claim backed by a number or named event
- Short sentences; scan-friendly bullets

**Vocabulary:**
- Prefer active voice: *"Team completed X"* not *"X was completed by the team"*
- Use concrete counts: *"36 stories blocked"* not *"several stories blocked"*
- Name stakeholders when asking or attention-flagging

**Sign-off style:** Brief — `Thanks, {name}` is standard (ref: Heineken example).

